TaiWei-Pin-3D: https://github.com/CODA-Team/TaiWei-Pin-3D. Used in flow/platforms/asap7_3D, flow/platforms/asap7_nangate45_3D (two-tier platforms), flow/route/cadence/ (Innovus routing scripts, written by Zhiyu Zheng, Fudan University), flow/Makefile (derived), inputs/ (placements produced with the Pin-3D flow). Modifications: platform and design configurations reduced to the CTS and routing steps; Innovus script reduced to routing. License: BSD-3-Clause, CODA-Team.

